- `i1 = bs_first(lambda i: pre[i] <= g(i), lo, hi)`
- `i2 = bs_last(lambda i: pre[i] >= g(i), lo, hi)`
- If both exist and `i1 <= i2`: count `i2 - i1 + 1`.

For category 3:
- `i1 = bs_first(lambda i: f(i) <= suf[i+1], lo, hi)`
- `i2 = bs_last(lambda i: f(i) >= suf[i+1], lo, hi)`
- If both exist and `i1 <= i2`: count `i2 - i1 + 1`.

